## Founder Story

Yaniv Simpson dedicated his early adulthood to professional basketball—a pursuit that demanded rigorous physical
conditioning and nutritional discipline. This career was truncated by four surgeries, forcing a transition from
athletics to entrepreneurship. Simpson's lifelong passion for chocolate combined with his athletic background in
nutrition optimization led to the creation of The Conscious Bar. Product development began in April 2019 with a $250
countertop chocolate refiner (melanger) in a New York City apartment. After 8 months searching for a manufacturing
partner capable of handling date-sweetened formulations, the brand officially launched in Miami, Florida in May 2021.

