## Sustainability Commitment

**The Problem**: Over 300 million tons of plastic waste generated annually. Traditional chocolate wrappers (aluminum +
plastic composites) are economically impossible to recycle.

**Our Solution - Home Compostable Packaging**: - 100% plastic-free wrappers - Paper-based with plant-derived coatings
(cellulose/PLA) - PEFC and FSC certified eucalyptus wood pulp - Decomposes in backyard compost (higher standard than
industrial compostable) - Even interior film wrappers and sealing stickers are biodegradable

