## Frequently Asked Questions

**Q: What makes The Conscious Bar healthier than other chocolate?** A: We use only two superfoods - organic cacao and
organic dates. No refined sugar, no preservatives, no emulsifiers, no soy lecithin, no seed oils. Just pure,
nutrient-dense ingredients.

**Q: Is this chocolate vegan?** A: Yes, all products are 100% vegan and plant-based with no dairy or eggs.

**Q: Is this chocolate keto-friendly?** A: Yes, in moderation. Each bar contains 6-9g of natural sugar from fiber-rich
dates (GI ~42), which can fit into most keto diets.

**Q: Is this chocolate gluten-free?** A: Yes, all bars are gluten-free. Some flavors contain tree nuts (hazelnuts,
almonds).

**Q: Where does the cacao come from?** A: Single-origin organic cacao from Semuliki Forest, Uganda (4,664 farmers via
Latitude Trade Company) and Ecuador (1,800 producers via CECAO/Uncommon Cacao).

**Q: Why direct trade instead of fair trade?** A: Direct trade allows us to pay farmers above market prices with full
transparency on compensation and timing, working directly rather than through intermediaries.

**Q: Is the packaging recyclable?** A: Better—it's 100% home compostable. Decomposes in backyard compost into organic
matter that enriches soil.

**Q: How should I store the chocolate?** A: Keep at 60-70°F in a cool, shaded place. Do not refrigerate (diminishes
flavor). No preservatives—consume within weeks of purchase.

**Q: Do you contain allergens?** A: Made in a facility that processes peanuts and tree nuts. Some flavors contain
hazelnuts, almonds, coconut, or sesame.

**Q: Do you ship internationally?** A: Currently US only (all 50 states). Orders ship Monday-Wednesday with ice packs.

**Q: What is your shipping policy?** A: Free shipping on orders over $70. Standard delivery is 2-4 business days via
express ground.

